<title>GERMANY: German Sept producer prices rise 0.2 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>German Sept producer prices rise 0.2 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> PAN GERMAN PRODUCER PRICES  Sept 96	Aug 96	Sept 95</p>
<p> Monthly figure		    +0.2	  unch	   +0.1</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr			    -0.6	  -0.7	   +1.9</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	  103.6	 103.4	  104.2</p>
<p>WEST GERMAN PRODUCER PRICES</p>
<p> Monthly figure		    +0.2	  unch	   +0.1</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr			    -0.8	  -0.9	   +2.0</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	  103.2	 103.0	  104.0</p>
<p>EAST GERMAN PRODUCER PRICES</p>
<p> Monthly figure		    +0.3	  +0.1	   +0.4</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr			    +1.6	  +1.7	   +1.4</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	  108.9	 108.6	  107.2</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
